title: "dispute-coordinator: restore disputes with their session validators"
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
    description: |
      After a validator restarts, recover active disputes using the validator set from
      each dispute's session. This preserves participation in disputes from earlier
      sessions when the current validator set has changed.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-node-core-dispute-coordinator
    bump: patch
